        "ggBuXqnlX5v_text": "2. PAIN-FREE APPLICATION<br>IN JUST ONE MINUTE",
        "ggDUaJgKbVe_text": "<strong>3. CLINICALLY VALIDATED &amp; DERMATOLOGIST APPROVED</strong>",
        "ggDgUGQ3BgZ_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><strong>We stand behind our results.</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:17px;\">If your hair doesn’t appear thicker and fuller after consistent use, return it <strong>within 90 days</strong>, and get a full refund, no questions asked.</span></p>",
