        "ggQcV0SPRl3_text": "<span style=\"font-size:24px;\">3. APPLICATION INDOLORE EN UNE MINUTE</span>",
        "ggUVMhu0dq0_text": "2. EFFORTLESS, PAINLESS, AND FAST",
        "ggYDJqukkP8_text": "<strong>4. </strong>90-DAY HAIR GROWTH&nbsp;<br>GUARANTEE – RISK-FREE",
        "ggZb395-ucR_text": "<span style=\"font-size:24px;\">5. REJOIGNEZ LA LÉGION DES HOMMES CONFIANTS</span>",
        "gg_jSn-ii-R_text": "<span style=\"font-size:24px;\">4. GARANTIE DE CROISSANCE DE 120 JOURS - ZÉRO RISQUE</span>",
        "ggageb314dy_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:18px;\">Tired of trying endless products that promise results but never deliver? Discover how <strong>REGROW™</strong> revitalizes your scalp from the inside out — for visibly thicker, stronger hair in record time, without complicated treatments.</span></p>",
        "gggsNSdZ6Nf_text": "<strong>5. JOIN THE LEGION OF CONFIDENT MEN</strong>",
        "ggigksYMOGT_text": "<p><strong>REGROW™</strong> works directly where hair loss begins, by reducing excess DHT and stimulating dormant follicles.</p><p><br>Our precision micro-needles create ultra-fine openings in the scalp, allowing the active serum to penetrate deeply, halt shedding in just one week, and trigger <strong>new growth within 8–10 weeks.</strong></p>",
        "ggjCATAKblz_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:17px;\">Forget endless steps or greasy products.</span><br><span style=\"font-size:17px;\">Simply apply the serum to thinning areas using the micro-infusion tool, it feels like a soft tap on the scalp. The entire process takes less than a minute, yet delivers visible improvement within the first week.</span></p>",
        "ggjkv5m1vuM_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:16px;\"><strong>ReGrow™ targets the root cause of hair loss: excess DHT.</strong></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:16px;\">The micro-needles create tiny openings in your scalp, ensuring the active formula penetrates deeply to stop hair loss within 1 week and trigger rapid regrowth in 8 to 10 weeks.</span></p>",
        "ggnvT7KBOpQ_text": "1. GO FROM HAIR LOSS TO A FULL HEAD OF HAIR — INSTANTLY",
        "ggpiz-sEMZs_text": "1. PASSEZ DE LA PERTE DE CHEVEUX À UNE CHEVELURE COMPLÈTE INSTANTANÉMENT",
        "ggqeDBNjmZ7_text": "<strong>4. 90-DAY MONEY-BACK PROMISE</strong>",
        "ggtYc7Qs-ws_text": "<strong>3. APPROVED AND RECOMMENDED BY TRICHOLOGISTS</strong>",
        "ggvaUBZF1D__text": "<span style=\"font-size:22px;\">5 Reasons Why REGROW™ Reactivates Hair Growth Naturally — Without the Usual Struggle</span>",
        "ggw0EF81rp6_text": "1. FROM THINNING HAIR TO DENSITY — FAST",
        "ggx9SeSwdGe_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:17px;\">Developed with leading trichologists, <strong>REGROW™</strong> combines powerful botanical actives like <strong>Panax Ginseng</strong> and <strong>Eclipta Prostrata</strong>, known for their ability to reactivate natural hair growth safely and effectively.</span></p>"
